  "changes": [
    "Pick/Wedge select one nearest eligible bot from the requested team; Recon/Control carry picks and Entry does not. Human tool entry obeys the same capability. Wedges spend actual assigned stock.",
    "The officer retains the reported point/door, finds supported physical reach, aims and holds the shared tool. Wrong-door tool rays cannot operate an unrelated door. Hold, visual threats, received gunshots and human takeover retain ordinary interruption/cancellation behavior.",
    "Protocol/replay v33 serializes active/queued door IDs. Decode bounds scalars; map-aware application rejects non-door/missing references before any mutation.",
    "Real motel UDP covers queued Pick, actual unlock, late human cancellation, and a remaining officer placing one wedge. Native socket tests share the approved test_net path transiently and restore it under the same lock.",
    "A full quiet route uses a queued wedge after occupants are accounted for, restores its journal checkpoint before Execute, physically closes/works/removes the wedge, and extracts with a truthful debrief."
